_id":"b-shiji-068","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-068-shang"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:p011","text":"商君，其天資刻薄人也。跡其欲干孝公以帝王術，挾持浮說，非其質矣。且所因由嬖臣，及得用，刑公子虔，欺魏將卬，不師趙良之言，亦足發明商君之少恩矣。余嘗讀商君開塞耕戰書，與其人行事相類。卒受惡名於秦，有以也夫！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003995","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003998","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"嬖臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、泛論或未定指代；不補族群成員、闕代或姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"公子虔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"魏將卬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"趙良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004010","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m011-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003995","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-068-shang","book_id":"b-shiji-068","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-068-shang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-068-shang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-068","source_id":"s-shiji-068-shang","source":{"title":"史記／卷068","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷068","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷068&oldid=8764712","revision_id":8764712,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"11段正文，自商君者至篇末論贊；排除頁首標題及2段導覽、h2索隱述贊以下後附評論、現代版權告示。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licens